# Scripts, SQL and units run on Linux. A CRLF checkout on Windows, copied to
# the host, fails with `$'\r': command not found` — pin them to LF everywhere.
*        text=auto
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.sql    text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer  text eol=lf
*.env.example text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
